?p5 What is the maximum capacity of the internal formatting buffer used during error rendering?
  = 40 bytes
  > src/ensure.rs::Buf #4a5b381c47a4
?p6 What trait bounds are required for a type to be used with Error::new?
  = The type must implement StdError + Send + Sync + 'static.
  > src/error.rs::Error.new #e23a67bf8e65
?p7 What assumption does the `vtable` function make about the layout of `ErrorImpl`?
  = It assumes that `ErrorVTable` is the first field of the `ErrorImpl` struct.
  > src/error.rs::vtable #2a024b6ce718
?p8 What specific requirement must be met to use Anyhow in no_std mode?
  = A global allocator is required.
